WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
Stop watching your AI work.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:03.450
Clawdy watches it for you.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:05.200
Amber. It's working.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.700
Red. It needs you.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.700
Green. It's done.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.050
On your desk.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.700 line:15%
And in your menu bar.

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:13.650
Clawdy.

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.750 line:15%
Walk away.
